Tokenizers

    1. Maps b/w text and token for a particular model
        Natural Language -> Tokens
        These Tokens are mapped to their token IDs

    2. Tokenizers have the dictionary as well
        - It had the list of all possible tokens and their IDs
        - It also contains special tokens that don't maps to any natural language word
            for example:
                "This is the start what I want to tell you"
                "This is the beginning of the the prompt"
            and these special tokens had their own token IDs

